  (text "MCP23017 retained from BOM for outputs. Powered at 3.3 V for Pico-safe I2C.\nAll 32 outputs used: 30 playfield lamps + 2 menu lamps.\n100k gate-to-source pull-downs hold lamps OFF while expanders reset to inputs."
